## Token diet

EN: Root session is chief only — plan, split, accept, audit. Implementation → `codex --profile worker` (`~/.codex/worker.config.toml`, low effort). Independent verify → `--profile reviewer` (read-only). Worker "done" is not acceptance. YAGNI. Terse: changed / verified / leftover. Do not set `ultra`/`xhigh` unless the user asks. Never put `[profiles.*]` in `config.toml` (Codex 0.147+ wants overlay files).

TR: Kök oturum yalnız şeftir. İş → `codex --profile worker`. Doğrulama → `--profile reviewer` (salt-okunur). İşçi «bitti» = aday. YAGNI. Çıktı kısa. `ultra`/`xhigh` yalnız kullanıcı isterse. `config.toml` içine `[profiles.*]` yazma.
